name: Lazy Pages
icon: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/lazy-pages/icon.svg
version: 1.0.1
creator: Mohtadi Azad Mahi
description: Lazy-loads the pages of big documents — only a window of pages around the one you're reading stays in the DOM, the rest are stashed and swapped back in as you scroll or in the background. Saves, exports, print and find/replace always include every page, and it pauses during live collaboration.
p/html: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/lazy-pages/lazy-pages.html
p/css: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/lazy-pages/lazy-pages.css
p/js: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/lazy-pages/lazy-pages.js
